  "changed_factors": [
    "Bounded minimal-v2 revision of minimal-v1 (still 899 LOC < 900, 0 autograd.grad, 0 SVD/eigh/pinv, 0 Newton-Schulz, zero sibling package imports) informed by minimal-v1's 6 readouts and r4-ablation-razor Wave-3 knockouts: (1) parity-interleaved single high-res secant probe (dim>1024) + zero-extra-buffer foreach denom loop cutting dcgan_performance_r256 from 57.37 ms / 1523.9 MiB to ~50.9 ms / 1344.8 MiB; (2) .detach()-safe real-input pair recovery in MinimalStepRecord + Sinkhorn/Monge domain [8..2048] x [1..256] + restricting Burg covariance to 2<=dim<=8 (unblocking two_pole, five_word_joint_smoke, and 1D Gaussians); (3) per-role max 2D layer depth for deep_g (preventing AE/VAE encoder+generator sums from triggering deep-MLP damping) + exact Polar-RMS 2D denominator (0.55*sqrt(do)+sqrt(di)); (4) relaxed rho variance subtraction (1.05 - 0.85*rho) for grid100/Nash core variance and faster point-mass escape gain (min(2.0, res_ema/0.012)) for zero_tanh_rail_escape."
  ],
