  "mechanism_rationale": "minimal-v1 established an 896-LOC zero-NS baseline passing clockfree_audit_measurement_v1, nash_overpowered_critic_ring16 (621x), t3_iso_scale_mass_8x (eig=0.8117), ring16_acquisition, ae_gan_hold, zero_tanh_smoke, and 6/6 dcgan_performance (57.37 ms/step), while exposing four surgical flaws: 2x high-res secant probe memory/time, stripped _minimal_input after .detach() on two_pole plus dim<=128 / batch>=32 Sinkhorn bounds excluding two_pole and five_word_joint_smoke, summed encoder+generator layer count tripping deep_g on AE/VAE models, and slight rho variance under-shoot (-0.097 on grid100, 0.135 on hostile Nash). minimal-v2 fixes all four in 899 total LOC without adding autograd.grad, SVD/eigh/pinv, or Newton-Schulz.",
